      "content": "Answer the following question with a single MySQL SQL query against the current database. Explore the semantic network and verify with mysql_query as needed. The SELECT list must contain exactly the columns the question asks for, in the asked order. When the final SQL is verified, call the submit_SQL tool with it.\n\nThe following hints are provided to help you write the SQL:\n\n## Gold Tables\n- IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL\n- ACADEMIC_TERMS\n- LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED\n- TIP_DETAIL\n\n## Column Mapping\n- enrollment type: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.ENROLLMENT_TYPE\n- Advance sign-up required: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.ENROLLMENT_TYPE\n- maximum enrollment: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.MAX_ENROLLMENT\n- 12: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.MAX_ENROLLMENT\n- activity title: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.ACTIVITY_TITLE\n- term code: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.TERM_CODE\n- term description: ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_DESCRIPTION\n- term start date: ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_START_DATE\n- subject title: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.SUBJECT_TITLE\n- number of enrolled students: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS\n- offer department name: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.OFFER_DEPT_NAME\n- responsible faculty name: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.RESPONSIBLE_FACULTY_NAME\n- window column: IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.ACTIVITY_TITLE, LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.SUBJECT_TITLE\n- highest number of associated course materials: TIP_DETAIL.TIP_MATERIAL_KEY\n- number of enrolled students is at least 10: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS\n- order the results by activity title within each subject title group: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.SUBJECT_TITLE, IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.ACTIVITY_TITLE\n\n## Join Keys\n- ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE <-> IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL.TERM_CODE\n- ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE <-> LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TERM_CODE\n- ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE <-> TIP_DETAIL.TERM_CODE\n\n## Question\nFor subjects with an enrollment type of \"Advance sign-up required\" and a maximum enrollment of 12, show the subject's activity title, term code, maximum enrollment, term description, term start date, subject title, number of enrolled students, offer department name, responsible faculty name, window column, and, for each activity title, also include the highest number of associated course materials it has had in any term. Only include results where the number of enrolled students is at least 10, and order the results by activity title within each subject title group. Do not return any rounded answers."
